      "side": 1,
      "message": "except BadfishException is broader than the \u0027unsupported\u0027 case: get_request raises BadfishException on transport failures, so a BMC outage is now reported as \u0027iDRAC version installed does not support DellJobService\u0027 and returns False. Verified A/B: get_request raising -\u003e parent propagates, patchset returns False. If the goal is \u0027returns False instead of raising\u0027 for an unsupported host, raise a distinct exception (e.g. ResourceNotFound) from _find_resource and map only that to False, so \u0027unreachable\u0027 stays distinguishable.",
